## IAM-001 — Administrative Permissions

### Finding

The IAM user `charlie` has the AWS managed policy `AdministratorAccess` attached directly.

### Observation

The user has broad administrative permissions across the AWS account.

### Risk

If the credentials associated with this identity were compromised, the attacker could potentially perform administrative actions across the AWS environment.

### Recommendation

Review whether administrative permissions are required. Where possible, replace broad administrative permissions with least-privilege permissions appropriate to the user's responsibilities.

### Status

Under Assessment
